---
description: Always-on rules for this repo
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read `NOW.md` first. Work only on the ticket it names.
- Before changing code, restate the ticket's "done when" in one line.
- Prefer editing the files the user @-mentioned. Ask before reading the whole repo.
- Pure logic goes in packages/core and must be unit-testable with Vitest.
- No `any`. Export Zod schemas and infer types from them.
- Keep functions under 40 lines; split instead of nesting.
- When unsure between two designs, state both in two lines and ask. Do not implement both.
- Never run git commit or git push. Never print or read `.env*` files.
- After finishing, list: files changed, how to verify, one risk. Nothing else.
